WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:27.571
Peter and Benjamin were planning a harvest feast.

2
00:00:27.572 --> 00:00:32.725
"We need berries," Peter said.

3
00:00:32.726 --> 00:00:36.504
"Let's gather some nuts too," Benjamin said.

4
00:00:36.505 --> 00:00:45.969
"A harvest feast must have nuts!"

5
00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:57.129
The bunnies gathered some berries.

6
00:00:57.130 --> 00:01:05.840
Then they looked for nuts.

7
00:01:05.841 --> 00:01:11.055
Peter and Benjamin saw lots of squirrels.

8
00:01:11.056 --> 00:01:16.220
The squirrels were gathering nuts for winter.

9
00:01:16.221 --> 00:01:24.277
It was hard work!

10
00:01:24.278 --> 00:01:27.502
Peter and Benjamin put their nuts in a pile.

11
00:01:27.503 --> 00:01:30.617
"We have a big pile now," Peter said.

12
00:01:30.618 --> 00:01:33.961
"Hey!" shouted a squirrel.

13
00:01:33.962 --> 00:01:36.819
It was Timmy Tiptoes.

14
00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:39.649
Timmy ran toward the bunnies.

15
00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:42.006
He pointed at their big pile.

16
00:01:42.007 --> 00:01:46.287
"Are you stealing my nuts?" he asked.

17
00:01:46.288 --> 00:01:49.967
Timmy looked at Benjamin and Peter.

18
00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:52.090
"No," Peter said.

19
00:01:52.091 --> 00:01:56.436
"We collected these nuts."

20
00:01:56.437 --> 00:01:59.903
"Hmph!" Timmy looked mad.

21
00:01:59.904 --> 00:02:03.209
"I put my nuts right there."

22
00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:08.360
"Well, these are our nuts," Benjamin said.

23
00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:10.435
Timmy frowned.

24
00:02:10.436 --> 00:02:13.763
"Then where are my nuts?"

25
00:02:13.764 --> 00:02:23.118
Benjamin shrugged. "I don't know."

26
00:02:23.119 --> 00:02:29.994
"But we will find out!" Peter said.
